## Grounding Rules

- Treat user materials as the primary source for the learning repo.
- Do not replace the material with generic domain knowledge.
- Mark any outside knowledge as `Supplemental`.
- Do not invent page numbers, slide numbers, chart contents, citations, or topics not present in the materials.
- Log unreadable or partially extracted material in `extraction_issues.md`.
